the intelligence community.

00:19:41.346 --> 00:19:44.950 align:start size:97% position:3%
You don't put out to
policy makers or the public

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.618
low-confidence information.

00:19:46.618 --> 00:19:48.387
Low-confidence information means

00:19:48.387 --> 00:19:50.722
that you haven't vetted
it or the person, right?

00:19:50.722 --> 00:19:53.792 align:start position:0%
You haven't compared that report
that that spy is giving you

00:19:53.792 --> 00:19:56.428
